//
//  Controller liveness, from the MQTT Last Will and Testament.  The LWT is the
//  only authoritative answer to 'is this controller on the bus': without it, 'no
//  reading' and 'no controller' look identical, and they are not.
//
//  🚨 A tunnel whose controller is silent has NO OVERHEAT PROTECTION and its
//  BUTTONS DO NOT WORK, while its temperature Items keep showing the last value
//  they were given.  That is the blind spot this closes.
//
//  A side is SILENT after 3 consecutive minute ticks not reporting Online.
//  Persisted on everyChange: rare transitions, and the history IS the record of
//  which controllers are flaky -- the lesson from tunnel 11, which ran 998 for 36
//  hours, recovered on its own, and was found days later only by digging.

